        "ImageDescription": {
          "value": "The <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Flag_of_NATO\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Flag of NATO\">flag of the North Atlantic Treaty Organization</a> (NATO). Color is <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20170925072110/http://www.nato.int/vigs/pdf/NATO-VIGs-2016-en.pdf\">PMS 280, RGB #004990</a>.",
