        "Credit": {
          "value": "<p><b>Current file:</b>\n</p>\n<ul><li>Source file on Wikimedia Commons <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Flag_of_NATO.svg\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Flag of NATO.svg\">Flag of NATO.svg</a> (January 2013)</li>\n<li>Itself copied from the following sites:\n<ul><li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://althistory.wikia.com/wiki/File:NATO_flag.svg\">http://althistory.wikia.com/</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://countries.wikia.com/wiki/File:NATO_flag.svg\">http://countries.wikia.com/</a></li>\n<li>Resaved by me (User: <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/User:475847394d347339\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:User:475847394d347339\">475847394d347339</a>) with Inkscape because for some reason, the original SVG file can't be viewed directly in a web browser through Inkscape opens it just fine. (January 2013)</li></ul></li>\n<li>Used the aforementioned image to update this file (Nov 2015)</li>\n<li>Color corrected to <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20170925072110/http://www.nato.int/vigs/pdf/NATO-VIGs-2016-en.pdf\">#004990</a> by User: <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/User:Kwamikagami\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:User:Kwamikagami\">Kwamikagami</a> (Jul 2022)</li></ul>\n<dl><dt>Previous file</dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n<ul><li>Official emblem of NATO at <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120216135033/http://www.nato.int/multi/natologo.htm\">www.nato.int</a></li></ul>",
          "source": "commons-desc-page"
        },
        "Artist": {
          "value": "<p><b>Current file:</b>\n</p>\n<ul><li>Found by <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/User:475847394d347339\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:User:475847394d347339\">475847394d347339</a> in websites noted in the source section.</li></ul>\n<dl><dt>Previous file</dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n<ul><li><b>Vectorization: </b> <a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/User:Mysid\" title=\"User:Mysid\">Mysid</a> and uploaded to <span style=\"border:1px dotted #FC0;padding:0 4px\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Flag_of_NATO.svg\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:File:Flag of NATO.svg\">Flag of NATO.svg</a></span></li>\n<li>Code cleaned up by <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/User:Artem_Karimov\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:User:Artem Karimov\">Artem Karimov</a>.</li></ul>",
          "source": "commons-desc-page"
        },
        "Permission": {
          "value": "<table style=\"width:100%; clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; border-spacing:8px; background-color:var(--background-color-neutral-subtle,#f7f8ff); border:2px solid #8888aa;color: inherit;\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"layouttemplate restrictiontemplate restriction-insignia\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"border:none; width:64px;\"><figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Commons:Non-copyright_restrictions\" title=\"Insignia\"><img alt=\"Insignia\" src=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d2/Coat-elements-2.png/120px-Coat-elements-2.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"64\" height=\"77\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d2/Coat-elements-2.png/250px-Coat-elements-2.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"609\" data-file-height=\"731\"></a><figcaption>Insignia</figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border:none;\">This image shows a <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/flag\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:flag\">flag</a>, a <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/coat_of_arms\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:coat of arms\">coat of arms</a>, a <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/seal_(emblem)\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:seal (emblem)\">seal</a> or some other official <b><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/insignia\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:insignia\">insignia</a></b>. The use of such symbols is restricted in many countries. These restrictions are independent of the <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/copyright\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:copyright\">copyright</a> status.\n</td></tr></tbody></table>",
